<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="610061"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1028416612"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="pink monsoon"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="May'n"/><amll:meta key="album" value="剧场版マクロスF~イツワリノウタヒメ~ pink monsoon"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:24.830"><div begin="00:01.150" end="04:24.830"><p begin="00:01.150" end="00:05.130" itunes:key="L1">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 粉色季风 宝贝 粉色季风</span></p><p begin="00:05.130" end="00:09.140" itunes:key="L2">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="00:09.140" end="00:12.300" itunes:key="L3">Lady sings love, hum<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女子吟唱爱情 嗯 我想抛弃理智</span></p><p begin="00:12.300" end="00:14.680" itunes:key="L4">I wanna lose control</p><p begin="00:14.680" end="00:21.630" itunes:key="L5">It's all about communication<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只求能和你沟通</span></p><p begin="00:27.640" end="00:34.590" itunes:key="L6">朝までふたり just spinning around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我相拥旋转至天明</span></p><p begin="00:34.590" end="00:42.030" itunes:key="L7">恋する時間はたっぷりあるのよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谈情说爱的时间完全足够</span></p><p begin="00:42.030" end="00:44.880" itunes:key="L8">Be my boyfriend</p><p begin="00:44.880" end="00:48.210" itunes:key="L9">若さをムダ使いしたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做我的男朋友吧</span></p><p begin="00:48.210" end="00:52.960" itunes:key="L10">一緒に脱線して台なしにして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起越轨肆无忌惮地浪费吧</span></p><p begin="00:52.960" end="00:56.550" itunes:key="L11">もっと深く関わってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我结下更深的情缘吧</span></p><p begin="00:56.550" end="00:57.960" itunes:key="L12">このposition<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个位置</span></p><p begin="00:57.960" end="01:04.330" itunes:key="L13">最高だってわかるでしょ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是最美妙的 你明白的吧</span></p><p begin="01:04.330" end="01:08.750" itunes:key="L14">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 粉色季风 宝贝 粉色季风</span></p><p begin="01:08.750" end="01:13.130" itunes:key="L15">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="01:13.130" end="01:16.330" itunes:key="L16">Lady sings love, hum<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女子吟唱爱情 嗯</span></p><p begin="01:16.330" end="01:21.140" itunes:key="L17">ガラス窓がくもっちゃう程scandal<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绯闻来袭 玻璃窗都变得模糊不清</span></p><p begin="01:21.140" end="01:25.500" itunes:key="L18">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 粉色季风 宝贝 粉色季风</span></p><p begin="01:25.500" end="01:29.300" itunes:key="L19">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="01:29.300" end="01:32.810" itunes:key="L20">Lady sings love hum.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女子吟唱爱情 嗯</span></p><p begin="01:32.810" end="01:39.920" itunes:key="L21">思う通りにして欲しいのよdon't stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要你尽情对我 不必犹豫</span></p><p begin="01:42.020" end="01:48.030" itunes:key="L22">たいがいのことは メチャクチャ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所谓的适可而止都已经一塌糊涂</span></p><p begin="01:48.030" end="01:49.990" itunes:key="L23">You know that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道我指的什么  可长发却整理的格外漂亮</span></p><p begin="01:49.990" end="01:56.580" itunes:key="L24">But 髪はきれいにしてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道的 但是发型却弄得很漂亮</span></p><p begin="01:56.580" end="01:58.970" itunes:key="L25">I'm old fashioned<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是个保守的女人</span></p><p begin="01:58.970" end="02:02.350" itunes:key="L26">100％ジュースな a kind of game<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我很保守</span></p><p begin="02:02.350" end="02:07.100" itunes:key="L27">かなりクレイジー I am crazy for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">很疯狂 我为你而疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:07.100" end="02:10.440" itunes:key="L28">もっと深く関わってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我结下更深的情缘</span></p><p begin="02:10.440" end="02:18.840" itunes:key="L29">そして 雨の日に放り出して!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后在雨天再把我逐出门外</span></p><p begin="02:18.840" end="02:22.660" itunes:key="L30">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 粉色季风 宝贝 粉色季风</span></p><p begin="02:22.660" end="02:26.700" itunes:key="L31">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="02:26.700" end="02:30.480" itunes:key="L32">Lady sings love, hum<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女子吟唱爱情 嗯</span></p><p begin="02:30.480" end="02:35.200" itunes:key="L33">あなたの指ここに触れるまでdon't stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到你的手指触及这 不要停止</span></p><p begin="02:35.200" end="02:39.490" itunes:key="L34">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 粉色季风 宝贝 粉色季风</span></p><p begin="02:39.490" end="02:43.560" itunes:key="L35">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="02:43.560" end="02:46.940" itunes:key="L36">Lady sings love, hum<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女子吟唱爱情 嗯 我想抛弃理智</span></p><p begin="02:46.940" end="02:49.190" itunes:key="L37">I wanna lose control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我渴望失控</span></p><p begin="02:49.190" end="02:53.090" itunes:key="L38">Hey you let's do communication<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 你 让我们互诉衷肠吧</span></p><p begin="02:53.090" end="02:59.330" itunes:key="L39">この世は全部幻だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使这个世界全是虚幻的</span></p><p begin="02:59.330" end="03:07.900" itunes:key="L40">すがりついたらそこが終わりだって</p><p begin="03:07.900" end="03:12.760" itunes:key="L41">一人でいたほうがいいと</p><p begin="03:12.760" end="03:26.980" itunes:key="L42">私に気づかせたなら 許さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若让我有这种感觉 我不会原谅你</span></p><p begin="03:31.390" end="03:37.970" itunes:key="L43">Baby pink monsoon</p><p begin="03:37.970" end="03:42.090" itunes:key="L44">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="03:42.090" end="03:45.240" itunes:key="L45">Lady sings love, hum<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女子吟唱爱情 嗯</span></p><p begin="03:45.240" end="03:50.300" itunes:key="L46">ガラス窓がくもっちゃう程scandal<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绯闻来袭 玻璃窗都变得模糊不清</span></p><p begin="03:50.300" end="03:54.310" itunes:key="L47">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="03:54.310" end="03:58.490" itunes:key="L48">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="03:58.490" end="04:02.210" itunes:key="L49">Lady sings love, hum<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女子吟唱爱情 嗯</span></p><p begin="04:02.210" end="04:07.320" itunes:key="L50">思う通りにして欲しいのよdon't stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你随心所欲地对我 别犹豫</span></p><p begin="04:07.320" end="04:11.200" itunes:key="L51">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 粉色季风 宝贝 粉色季风</span></p><p begin="04:11.200" end="04:15.330" itunes:key="L52">Baby pink monsoon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉红季风来袭</span></p><p begin="04:15.330" end="04:19.050" itunes:key="L53">Lady sings love, hum<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女子吟唱爱情 嗯</span></p><p begin="04:19.050" end="04:21.310" itunes:key="L54">I wanna lose control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想抛弃理智</span></p><p begin="04:21.310" end="04:24.830" itunes:key="L55">Hey you let's do communication<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 你 让我们互诉衷肠吧</span></p></div></body></tt>